      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e5d403166386261feeb2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353d55bc127360972ad82916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘘……听到了。那试图唤醒我的\r\n崇高之声。\r\n这声是，喔……喔……喔喔喔——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3f1d519013608fbe3d5a98050241fc28a965f57e8531b3742f10e29b2a168c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d4701b381ef3b874f660b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……啊，抱歉！昨晚\r\n不小心看异世界转生小说太入迷了……\r\n没想到勇者竟然是亲姐姐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e022485335d580dfc68c13f656cf55393e9f56b86b3dabc20dfd107c2d0dcf6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467a860b123b9168b1647f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎接试炼的良机到来了。\r\n来吧！今天在食堂\r\n要挑战几级辣度的咖喱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "853c74c292be33c29870a161a49f25a94a33ba60b36ca4d303c00da9e729cdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad1720b263d4f099cc46197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……呵呵。方才得到的神谕说\r\n能遇上贵人。\r\n果然应验了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "942338f7d6933d3c414b43fc5aeb4cd2289b63b093dab6f138fed3b35e5584b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb415dba086f656e8746fdfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暗夜令人无助，徒增不安……\r\n您什么都不必说，没关系的。\r\n就由我的光芒来温暖您吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea795f2e0f9cec1d3011af87d54a4132a13cb54e43c1792d3fb623d1bf0c09e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90004"
      ]
    }
  ]
